  <Strings>
    <Section>s0-0</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2159</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あっ♪
おいしそうなものが入ってるヨ！
ちょっと食べちゃおっと。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oba! Parece que tem algo gostoso
aqui! Deixa eu dar uma provada.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2183</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Green&gt;『&lt;item:20000002&gt;』を食べました。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Green&gt;Comeu "&lt;item:20000002&gt;."</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2232</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Green&gt;『&lt;item:20000002&gt;』のレシピを入手しました。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Green&gt;Obteve a receita de "&lt;item:20000002&gt;"!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>-1</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>[VARIABLE]</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>[VARIABLE]</EnglishText>
      <Notes>DON'T EDIT THIS, IT'S A DUMMY ENTRY</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Done</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2329</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Green&gt;料理が入っていました。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Green&gt;Há comida aqui dentro.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2353</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Green&gt;……しかし、誰のものかわからないので
とりあえず、袋を閉じました。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Green&gt;Como você não sabe de
quem é, deixa por enquanto.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
  <Strings>
    <Section>s0-1</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2420</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あーあ……
あんなふざけたガジュマと
一緒に働いてらんないわ。
</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ugh... Não quero trabalhar
com aquele Gajuma de araque.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2442</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>やってらんないわよ……
転職しようかしら……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Não aguento mais...
Talvez eu deva mudar de emprego?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2467</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>お客は来ないし……
うちの店長、営業努力が
足りないのよね……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Não temos clientes, e meu chefe
nem se esforça pra trabalhar...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2489</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>レジは壊れたまんまで
買い換えてくれないし……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ele nem comprou uma caixa
registradora nova depois que
a antiga quebrou...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
  <Strings>
    <Section>s2-0</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3982</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;speed:0&gt;&lt;scale:140&gt;休憩しますか？
　はい　
　いいえ　</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;speed:0&gt;&lt;scale:140&gt;Quer descansar?
Sim
Não</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <Status>Done</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
  <Strings>
    <Section>s2-1</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2076</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;speed:0&gt;『見下ろした風景』
ミナールの街並みが描かれている。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;speed:0&gt;- Cenário de Baixo -
Uma pintura das ruas de Minal.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
  <Strings>
    <Section>s2-2</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2048</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;speed:0&gt;『父と母の肖像』
二人の人が並んでいる。
店主が描いたらしい。
</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;speed:0&gt;- Retrato de Pai e Mãe -
Há duas pessoas desenhadas. Parece
que o dono que desenhou.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
  <Strings>
    <Section>s2-3</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1946</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>１０００ガルド足す
８００ガルド……は……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>1000 Gald mais
800 Gald é...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5,0,6,7,8,9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1969</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>…………</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5,0,6,7,8,9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1992</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>０ガルド？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>0 Gald?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5,0,6,7,8,9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2016</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;speed:0&gt;『壊れたレジスター』
　計算ができない。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;speed:0&gt;- Caixa Quebrada -
É impossível calcular com ela.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
  <Strings>
    <Section>s2-4</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>956</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ヒューマの女が辞めて、
せいせいしたよ。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Que bom que aquela Huma
finalmente foi embora.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>10</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>978</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あの給料ドロボウめ……
働かないくせに
給料はしっかり持ってってさ。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Aquela ladra não trabalhava,
só esperava o próximo
pagamento!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>10</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1338</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いらっしゃい、何にする？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Olá, bem-vindos! O que
gostariam de pedir?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>10</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1361</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;speed:0&gt;&lt;scale:140&gt;　ミナール貝のパエリヤ　
　レモンのアップルパイ　
　パスパスパスタ　
　ムカデのから揚げ　
　アイスクリームのソテー</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;speed:0&gt;&lt;scale:140&gt;Minalian Shellfish Paella
Lemon Apple Pie
Hasta Pasta
Deep-fried Centipede
Sauteed Ice Cream</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>11</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1413</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんだい、なんだい
ここまで来て、何も
頼まないっていうのかい!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Só pode ser brincadeira!
Vem até aqui e muda
de ideia?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>10</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1448</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>じゃあ、これから
貝を獲りに行くから
待っててくれるかい？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Tudo bem, vou buscar uns mariscos.
Importa-se de esperar?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>10</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1488</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>何？　待てない？
まったく、辛抱のない連中だな。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Quê? Não vai esperar?
Tsc. Gente impaciente.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>10</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1523</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そんなもん
あるわけないだろ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Por que uma coisa dessas existe?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>10</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1576</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そりゃあ出せねえな。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Vou ter que recusar
servir isso a você.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>10</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1630</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おまえ、ムカデなんて
食うのかよ!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Vai comer centopeia
MESMO!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>10</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1670</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんだよ!?　食わねえのか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>O quê!? Então não vai!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>10</SpeakerId>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1706</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>１０００万ガルドだ。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>1.000.000 Gald.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>10</SpeakerId>
      <Id>32</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1746</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>何？　ない？
食い逃げしようってのか!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Quê? Não tem esse dinheiro!?
Vai mesmo sair sem
pagar, é?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>10</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1050</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>新しいレジ係、
雇おうかな……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Devo contratar uma nova caixa...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>10</SpeakerId>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1072</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でもあの娘以外は
あのいかれたレジ
まともに触れないしな……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Mas só ela sabia mexer naquela
caixa registradora maluca...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>10</SpeakerId>
      <Id>35</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1144</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いやぁ、ヒューマを
からかうのは楽しいねー。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hahaha, provocar Huma é
muito divertido~.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>10</SpeakerId>
      <Id>36</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1166</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ありもしないメニューを言ったら、
連中、目を白黒させてさ。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Eles ficam bem atrapalhados quando
digo itens falsos que não
estão no cardápio.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>10</SpeakerId>
      <Id>37</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1224</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あんたが今、
覚えているレシピは……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>As receitas que você conhece são...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>10</SpeakerId>
      <Id>38</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1273</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>「&lt;unk1A:D8000000203844049880&gt;」は
　覚えているな。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;unk1A:D8000000203844049880&gt;</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>10</SpeakerId>
      <Id>39</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1306</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ま、がんばって
色々覚えてくれよ。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Bem, boa sorte e
aprenda bastante.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>10</SpeakerId>
      <Id>40</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
</SceneText>
